#speaker: NPC  
Hey, you hear about the new security cameras?  

#speaker: Player  
What about them?  

#speaker: NPC  
Someone online says they aren’t even cameras—they’re listening devices.  

* [Sounds like a stretch. Any proof?] -> QuestionClaim  
* [Why would they do that?] -> ExploreMotivation  
* [Huh… maybe I should be more careful what I say.] -> PlayAlong  

=== QuestionClaim ===  
#speaker: Player  
Sounds like a stretch. Any proof?  

#speaker: NPC  
Well… no, but why else would they put them up?  

#speaker: Player  
Maybe for security?  

#speaker: NPC  
Yeah… okay, when you say it like that, it does sound kinda dumb.  

-> END  

=== ExploreMotivation ===  
#speaker: Player  
Why would they do that?  

#speaker: NPC  
To track what we say! Keep tabs on us!  

#speaker: Player  
If they wanted to, they’d probably use something smaller than street cameras.  

#speaker: NPC  
…Dang, didn’t think of that.  

-> END  

=== PlayAlong ===  
#speaker: Player  
Huh… maybe I should be more careful what I say.  

#speaker: NPC  
Exactly! Never know who’s listening.  

#speaker: Player  
Yeah… or maybe you’re just being paranoid.  

#speaker: NPC  
Hey! Better safe than sorry!  

-> END  
